# The frozen data and the kept parts of main keep every byte, CRLF line ends included, so git
# never converts their line ends, whatever core.autocrlf says (ADR-0021, Large files and data,
# statement 3; ADR-0028, Checks, statement 5). The hooks that fix files skip the same paths,
# except the READMEs of this repository's suites (.pre-commit-config.yaml).
data/** -text
artifacts/** -text
